# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: OpenAction and ClosedAction are disjoint. 351-47-04
# requires the output variable to influence itself continuously, 351-47-06
# only under conditions that do not act permanently. An action is one or the
# other, which is what test case 3 turns on.
@prefix iec60050: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#> .
@prefix inst:     <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050/instances#> .
@prefix ex:       <https://w3id.org/aias/example/iec60050/neg#> .
@prefix owl:      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/iec60050/neg03> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050/instances/1.0.0> .
ex:Action1 a iec60050:OpenAction , iec60050:ClosedAction .
